# NestJS API source layout

Follow `apps/api/AGENTS.md`. Package manager is **pnpm**. Listen port **3001**. Prisma schema is `apps/api/prisma/`, never under `src`.

## Folder split

```
apps/api/src/
  main.ts, app.module.ts
  config/           # configuration.ts — env → typed config
  module/           # one folder per HTTP resource
  infrastructure/   # storage, notifications, brokker (RabbitMQ spelling)
  shared/           # prisma, decorators, guards, dto, middleware, utils
```

Do not put MinIO/Keycloak/Rabbit clients inside a feature folder.

## Feature module (`src/module/<name>/`)

Usually plural (`articles`). Exception: `video`.

- `<name>.module.ts` — register in `app.module.ts` `imports`
- `<name>.controller.ts` — HTTP only; delegate to service
- `<name>.service.ts` — Prisma + business rules; inject `PrismaService`, never `new PrismaClient`
- `dto/` — one class per file (`create-*.dto.ts`, `update-*.dto.ts`, `list-*-query.dto.ts`)
- optional `<name>.processor.ts` for BullMQ

Controllers: `@Controller('resource-path')`, `@ApiTags`, `ParseUUIDPipe` for UUIDs, `@CurrentDbUser()` from `shared/decorators`. Public reads unauthenticated. Writes: `AuthGuard('keycloak')` + `UserProvisioningGuard` + `RolesGuard` + `@Roles(...)`.

Pagination: `shared/dto/pagination-query.dto.ts`. Shared imports: relative `../../shared/...`.

## Bootstrap

- Import `./shared/utils/tracing` **before** `NestFactory`
- Global `ValidationPipe`: `whitelist`, `transform`, `forbidNonWhitelisted`
- New env keys go in `src/config/configuration.ts` then `ConfigService`
